      "message": "fix(app): the cross-drill holder refusal reads cleanly and names material, not a radius\n\nPR #219 review: the station refusal's format string lost its line\ncontinuations (about 22 stray spaces in three places), said 'the stock's\nradius' for a distance along the hole line (and for part material), and\nadvised raising the clearance, which cannot help on the holder's own\nstation. Pins assert the full spaced text.\n\nRefs #119\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
